# Rust
/target/
**/target/
*.pdb

# Local edge database and runtime state
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
/data/
/deploy/**/data/

# The device simulator's NVS-equivalent state file, and the copies its
# fail-closed path sets aside. Runtime state, like the database above: it
# records what a particular device did, and committing one would hand every
# clone another device's deduplication ring and spent budget.
*.state.json
*.state.json.corrupt
*.state.json.tmp

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
deploy/mosquitto/passwd

# Tauri / UI build output
/ui/**/dist/
/ui/**/gen/

# ESP32 build output
/firmware/**/.embuild/

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
# Shared editor configuration: the launch and build tasks a developer needs to
# start a node and step through it. Everything else under .vscode/ is personal
# (window layout, per-machine settings) and stays out.
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json

# Rust build output from planning tooling
/tools/docscheck/target/

# Machine-specific Claude Code notes — never shared
CLAUDE.local.md

# Machine-specific Codex notes — never shared
AGENTS.override.md
